"""
shortcut_isolator.py  (v2 — class-stratified splits + root-cause analysis)
===========================================================================
2 × 2 Shortcut Isolation Experiment.

Key fix from v1: ChestX6's GroupShuffleSplit on raw patient_id produced a
fully class-separated split (Train=ALL Normal, Test=ALL Emphysema).
This script:
  1. Reports the class structure BEFORE and AFTER each split strategy.
  2. Uses CLASS-STRATIFIED patient splits (split Normal patients and
     Emphysema patients independently, then combine) to ensure both
     classes are present in both train and test.
  3. Runs all 4 experiments with the corrected splits.

Experiments (on corrected splits):
  A) ChestX6 — Real labels
  B) ChestX6 — Random labels
  C) NIH     — Real labels
  D) NIH     — Random labels
"""

